                                "sense_id": "e65351a1-3f99-35fd-bebb-57f988d4805e",
                                "text": "A huge, slobby dog was in love with another huge, slobby dog wearing a pink bow in her collar […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0efd4398-59dd-4140-89a0-ce97d012521b",
                                "sense_id": "e65351a1-3f99-35fd-bebb-57f988d4805e",
                                "text": "All chewed and slobby with spit. He must have taken huge bites. Like someone starving."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
